sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Browser A
    participant A as Agent A
    participant S as Server
    participant B as Agent B
    UI->>A: POST /api/messages
    A-->>UI: 202 message_id
    A->>S: CHAT_SEND over reliable UDP
    S-->>A: CHAT_RECEIPT ACCEPTED_BY_SERVER
    S->>B: CHAT_DELIVER
    B->>B: Admit to application state
    B-->>S: CHAT_RECEIPT DELIVERED_TO_RECIPIENT
    S-->>A: Forward validated delivery receipt
    UI->>A: GET /api/events
    A-->>UI: MESSAGE_STATUS_CHANGED
    Note over A,B: Transport ACKs confirm immediate-peer receipt only
